    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Echo\u2019s Inc \u2013 Overview</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A once-thriving tech company researching A.I. and lucid dreaming has gone dark. You are <strong>Melvin</strong>, a former employee and horror streamer, returning after a decade of silence.<br>Reality unravels as you explore the facility. Shadows whisper. Something still watches.<br>This is more than horror\u2014it\u2019s a descent into the unknown.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3039010/extras/157f44728b0d970d7769bd8dab9cd7cb.poster.avif?t=1755275618\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3039010/extras/157f44728b0d970d7769bd8dab9cd7cb.webm?t=1755275618\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3039010/extras/157f44728b0d970d7769bd8dab9cd7cb.mp4?t=1755275618\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gameplay</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore. Observe. Survive.</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >First-person psychological horror</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No combat\u2014just tension, puzzles, and environmental storytelling</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Navigate a decaying facility filled with hidden areas and disturbing clues</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Items are subtly highlighted\u2014no pixel hunting</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3039010/extras/88cd3bf3639e3cd4cd3fcd1c85cfbbfc.poster.avif?t=1755275618\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3039010/extras/88cd3bf3639e3cd4cd3fcd1c85cfbbfc.webm?t=1755275618\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3039010/extras/88cd3bf3639e3cd4cd3fcd1c85cfbbfc.mp4?t=1755275618\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Visuals &amp; Atmosphere</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Volumetric lighting, fog, and post-processing effects blur dreams and reality</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shifting spaces and unnatural shadows build a sense of dread</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Visual effects tie directly into the psychological experience</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3039010/extras/8c78e5cf957a62125a886498b53b63de.poster.avif?t=1755275618\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3039010/extras/8c78e5cf957a62125a886498b53b63de.webm?t=1755275618\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3039010/extras/8c78e5cf957a62125a886498b53b63de.mp4?t=1755275618\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Narrative-driven, 1\u20132 hour experience</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immersive horror without combat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Story told through environments, documents, and audio logs</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Subtle item highlights for smooth interaction</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hidden content for replayability</p></li></ul>",
