        "notes": "This game contains intense horror elements designed to create a chilling and immersive experience. The content includes:\r\n\r\n    Graphic Horror Themes: The game features vivid and unsettling horror scenarios, including depictions of fear-inducing environments and supernatural occurrences.\r\n    Violence: There are scenes of violence that are integral to the horror experience. These depictions are intended to enhance the atmosphere and sense of dread.\r\n    Swearing: The game includes strong language to maintain an authentic and intense horror experience.\r\n\r\nPlease note that while the game does not contain depictions of sexual acts, sexual assault, drug or alcohol abuse, or self-harm, the atmosphere and content are designed to be disturbing and frightening. Viewer discretion is advised."
